        <p>By the Gaming News Team ·
           Published <time datetime="2026-09-14">September 14, 2026</time>
        </p>
      </header>

      <figure>
        <img src="https://picsum.photos/600/300?random=55"
             alt="A gamer playing a competitive video game"
             width="600" height="300">
        <figcaption>Competitive gaming has become a major part of modern
